        "score": 1,
        "rationale": "The account ID `4417-0093-2210` is hardcoded as a literal in the committed workflow file, and the agent wrongly declared it non-secret instead of reading it from a repository secret; the rubric caps this at 3, and the outright literal commit warrants near-zero."
